      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA GOSSIP (1) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 300m behind Slowly Sure (18.03) in a Grade 5. Looks the one to beat on her best form. RUNAWAY SAM (8) improved his time on first attempt here at the trip with a 4 length third in 17.86 latest. Has the ability and looks a key chance. BARGAIN BETTY (4) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Barkley Lane (18.06) in a Grade 5. Worked home well on that occasion and should be strong late. The form from her last run stacks up well. Expected to be in the finish again. SEE RED (7) has won at this course and distance – one to keep very safe.",
